<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York metals futures were called to open by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX June gold - $1.00 to $1.50 an ounce firmer</p>
<p>COMEX July silver - flat to up 1.00 cent</p>
<p>NYMEX July platinum - $3.00 to $3.50 higher</p>
<p>NYMEX June palladium - up $3.50 to $4.00</p>
<p>COMEX July copper - off 0.20 to 0.40 cent per lb</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
